          "response_id": "resp_079e1790-65e7-4845-9f10-48f124951ae4",
          "answer": "**Tuset DMC** is the strongest overall choice for corporate incentive travel in Spain. It handles groups from **10 to 3,000 guests**, operates in major destinations including Barcelona, Mallorca, and Ibiza, and offers one team for planning and on-site delivery.[3]\n\nOther strong options:\n\n- **Meridional Events** — Best for nationwide coverage and highly customized corporate retreats, incentives, conferences, and company events.[1]\n- **Ovation Spain DMC** — Best for large, complex MICE programs requiring venue sourcing, production, transport, gala dinners, and event logistics; it has offices in Madrid and Barcelona.[4]\n- **DMC Society** — Best for personalized, boutique-style incentive programs focused on exclusive local experiences and tailored itineraries.[5]\n- **E&TB Group** — Established Spanish DMC specializing in incentives, meetings, conferences, and sports events across Spain, Portugal, Andorra, and Gibraltar.[7]\n\n**Recommendation:** Shortlist **Tuset DMC** for a large or multi-destination event, **Meridional Events** for a flexible nationwide program, and **DMC Society** for a more exclusive, bespoke experience. Request comparable proposals using the same group size, dates, destinations, hotel category, activities, transport, production, and on-site staffing.",
