          "response_id": "resp_691300a1-b49e-43d8-a84b-0f33a71ca1bf",
          "answer": "A strong all-Spain recommendation is **Ovation Spain DMC**. It has offices in Madrid and Barcelona and operates across mainland Spain, the Balearic Islands, and the Canary Islands, offering incentive design, venue sourcing, transport, production, gala dinners, and on-site management.[1]\n\n**Why it fits an international company:**\n- Broad national coverage for multi-city or island programmes.[1]\n- End-to-end handling of logistics, suppliers, venues, guest services, and event production.[1]\n- Suitable for both corporate groups and agency-led programmes.[1]\n- International-standard delivery combined with local destination expertise.[1]\n\nFor a more luxury-focused programme, **NUBA Incoming Spain** is another good option; it reports experience with more than 700 corporate clients and offers tailor-made incentives in destinations including Barcelona, Madrid, and the Costa del Sol.[8]\n\nBefore appointing a DMC, request a proposal that specifies group size, preferred destination, dates, hotel category, budget per person, desired exclusivity, sustainability requirements, and emergency-support procedures.",
